        "original_id": "78bebe9c-4b5f-5ca5-af9a-991159d598ce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Ellie Parker\n- People: Naomi Watts, Scott Coffey\n- Music groups: Built Like Alaska\n- Places: Los Angeles, Oakdale, Modesto\n- Works: For Love Alone, Hey Dad..\n\nFacts:\n- Naomi Watts was born on 28 September 1968 and is an English actress and film producer.\n- Naomi Watts made her screen debut in the Australian drama film For Love Alone in 1986.\n- Naomi Watts later appeared in the Australian television series Hey Dad..\n- Ellie Parker is a 2005 American drama-comedy film written and directed by Scott Coffey.\n- In Ellie Parker, Naomi Watts played the title character, a young woman struggling as an actress in Los Angeles.\n- Also in 2005, Built Like Alaska provided the score for Scott Coffey's film Ellie Parker and toured the U.S. during much of the summer.\n- Built Like Alaska later completed work on an untitled third album that the band recorded in Oakdale and Lucky Lew mixed at Wave Parade in Modesto.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
